    "body": "## Description\n\nAdds guard and consistency unit tests for version functions in `tests/test_version.cpp`:\n- A guard test asserting that `version_string()` is not empty (`REQUIRE_FALSE(empty())`) and locks the current version to `\"0.1.0\"`.\n- A consistency test asserting that `version_major()`, `version_minor()`, and `version_patch()` match their respective expected integer values (`0`, `1`, `0`) and that formatting them together as `<major>.<minor>.<patch>` equals `version_string()`.\n\nFixes #53\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [ ] Bug fix\n- [ ] New feature\n- [ ] Documentation update\n- [ ] Refactor\n- [x] Tests\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] I have read the CONTRIBUTING.md guide.\n- [x] My code follows the project's coding standards.\n- [x] I have added tests that prove my fix is effective or that my feature works.\n- [ ] I have updated the documentation accordingly.\n- [x] All new and existing tests pass.\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-23T06:00:54Z",
